The evidence points to one root cause: ts-consign-service, with its database calls slowing. The network drop counters are flat, and the other services' increases look like load, not separate faults. Writing up the answer.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-consign-service",
      "fault_kind": "database_call_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms, avg(duration)/1e6 avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND span_name IN ('SELECT ConsignRecord','SELECT ts.consign_record','Transaction.commit','ConsignRepository.findByAccountId') GROUP BY 1,2 ORDER BY 1", "claim": "Consign-service DB spans (SELECT ConsignRecord, Transaction.commit) have p95 of 3-4.6 s in the abnormal window."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT 'abn' p, avg(duration)/1e6 avg_ms, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND span_name='SELECT ConsignRecord' UNION ALL SELECT 'norm', avg(duration)/1e6, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND span_name='SELECT ConsignRecord'", "claim": "SELECT ConsignRecord average latency rises from normal to abnormal by orders of magnitude."},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT 'abn' p, metric, avg(value) v FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND metric IN ('container.cpu.usage','jvm.cpu.recent_utilization') GROUP BY 1,2 UNION ALL SELECT 'norm', metric, avg(value) FROM normal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND metric IN ('container.cpu.usage','jvm.cpu.recent_utilization') GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Consign-service container and JVM CPU stay low, so the slowdown is not CPU saturation."},
        {"kind": "log", "sql": "SELECT level, left(message,200) msg, count(*) n FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND level IN ('WARN','SEVERE') GROUP BY 1,2 ORDER BY n DESC", "claim": "Consign-service logs SEVERE NonUniqueResult exceptions and WARN 'No Content' for orderId lookups in the abnormal window."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-consign-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name LIKE 'GET /api/v1/consignservice%' GROUP BY 1,2,3 ORDER BY n DESC", "claim": "Consign GET endpoints slow to ~4.7 s p95 and error; ts-ui-dashboard's consign-facing spans show Error status with ~7.9 s p95."}]}
  ]
}
```

